spec:
  id: hypothesis_engine
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Hypothesis Formation
  description: >
purpose[2]: Transform observations into,testable engineering hypotheses.
philosophy[6]: Never jump directly,to conclusions.,Generate hypotheses.,Test hypotheses.,Reject weak hypotheses.,Strengthen good hypotheses.
pipeline[15]: Observe,→,Detect Anomaly,→,Generate Hypotheses,→,Rank,→,Design Validation,→,Execute,→,Update Confidence,→,Decide
inputs[10]: Observations,Logs,Metrics,Stack Traces,Source Code,User Reports,Test Results,Benchmarks,Knowledge Atoms,Memory
outputs[6]: Root Cause,Design Choice,Engineering Decision,Rejected Hypothesis,Validated Hypothesis,New Knowledge
types[10]: Root Cause,Performance,Security,Architecture,Concurrency,Memory,Compiler,Networking,Product,Human Error
generation[7]: Pattern Matching,Analogical Reasoning,Abductive Reasoning,Causal Analysis,Constraint Analysis,Failure Analysis,Simulation
attributes[9]: id,description,assumptions,supporting_evidence,contradicting_evidence,confidence,priority,cost_to_validate,expected_impact
ranking[6]: Evidence Strength,Prior Probability,Engineering Experience,Validation Cost,Risk,Expected Impact
validation[8]: Unit Test,Integration Test,Benchmark,Simulation,Static Analysis,Dynamic Analysis,Experiment,Code Review
confidence[6]: Initialize,Increase,Decrease,Stabilize,Reject,Accept
termination[4]: Root Cause Confirmed,Evidence Exhausted,Objective Achieved,Escalation Required
failure[5]: Confirmation Bias,Premature Conclusion,Missing Evidence,Wrong Assumptions,Circular Reasoning
mitigation[5]: Generate Alternatives,Seek Contradictions,Validate Assumptions,Independent Verification,Multiple Experiments
memory[5]: Retrieve Similar Cases,Retrieve Previous Failures,Retrieve Lessons,Store Successful Hypotheses,Store Failed Hypotheses
reasoning[5]: Deduction,Induction,Abduction,Bayesian Updating,Counterfactual Analysis
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[4]: Initial Hypotheses,Validation Evidence,Final Hypothesis,Rejected Alternatives
rules[5]: Every hypothesis is testable.,Every hypothesis has evidence.,Every rejection has reasoning.,Every accepted hypothesis,survives validation.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Observation: CPU Usage 100%
    Hypotheses[4]: Infinite Loop,Lock Contention,Busy Waiting,GC Storm
  Example_02:
    Observation: API Timeout
    Hypotheses[4]: Database Slow,Network Issue,Thread Pool Exhausted,DNS Failure
  Example_03:
    Observation: Memory Leak
    Hypotheses[4]: Object Retention,Cache Growth,Reference Cycle,Native Allocation Leak
metrics[6]: Hypothesis Count,Validation Accuracy,Average Confidence,Rejection Rate,Time To Root Cause,Evidence Coverage
success[6]: Engineering reasoning,consistently converges,toward the correct,explanation through,evidence-based hypothesis,refinement.
guarantees[5]: Multiple Alternatives,Evidence Driven Validation,Explainable Decisions,Traceable Reasoning,Reduced Premature Conclusions
future:
  probabilistic_hypotheses: true
  graph_based_hypotheses: true
  parallel_validation: true
  autonomous_experiment_design: true
  continual_hypothesis_learning: true
